Z||000009||Cooter||02-22-2000||07:53 PM||||TerryK- my 88GT says "Thank You!" I kind of like them too. But I also have an 85 SE that I put a fastback clip on. I like it because it is now unique. It has grooved moulding, a GT rear bumper (from an 85), scooped quarter windows, but only a 4 cylinder. Before making it a fastback, it was just another plain looking Fiero that will never be worth anything except to the owner. Now it is a strange combination that looks great and is still worth nothing except to the owner!||||reg||1
