Z||000012||Monkeyman||02-23-2000||04:21 AM||||The Ferrari's not any shorter than the Fiero.  It just looks that way because of the profile.  If you took a Fiero and gave it a longer, pointier nose and tail, you'd be surprised at how it looks.  I'm not saying that a lower, sleeker look wouldn't look better just that you can't go much lower than the Fiero.  I happen to like the look of the "Purple Pavement Eater", but at over 6" tall, I couldn't fit comfortably in it.  (I don't, however, like Archies chopped fastback in the 1st pic.)||||reg||1
